The `TacticalBlade.svelte` component implements a file system browser and command interface, often referred to as a "blade". It allows the user to navigate the file system, select files (triggering the `onFileSelect` event), and execute system commands. It features an omnibox-style input for filtering files or entering commands, keyboard navigation, and a visual representation of the file system hierarchy. It also includes functionality to toggle Vim mode via the `onToggleVim` event. The component is designed to be a floating panel that appears and disappears based on the `open` prop, and it provides a way to interact with the underlying system through file selection and command execution.

